WEBVTT

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:05.820
Move it or I'll beat the crap outta ya!

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:09.200
No! GO AWAY!

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:14.120
Humans eating other humans?

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:15.840
What a sick joke.

00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:19.560
This isn't happening. There's no way this is happening.

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:23.120
Right, Mom? Right?

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:29.560
Where are we going, Takagi?

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:31.890
What, did you have something else to do?

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:35.020
Well, I was thinking of going to the staff room...

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:36.390
That's stupid.

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:39.440
What the hell do you expect our teachers to do?

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:41.960
But Takagi...

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:43.960
In this...

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:46.330
In this situation...

00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:50.400
I have a question.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:52.080
W-What is it?

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:56.170
Do you wanna die? Or do you wanna live?

00:00:56.950 --> 00:00:59.340
Uhm, well...

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:04.590
See, there's some people standing outside the office who had the same idea as you.

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:04.310
Teacher!

00:01:04.310 --> 00:01:05.390
Teacher!

00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:11.170
I wanna live!

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:12.180
Understand?

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:16.280
Move it, fatass!

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:17.980
Okay...

00:01:41.930 --> 00:01:52.760
<i>Yureta Genjitsukan Nakushita mama de</i>

00:01:41.930 --> 00:01:52.760
<i>As I lose my already shaken touch with reality,</i>

00:01:53.010 --> 00:01:57.810
<i>Gareki no Youni Tsumikasanaru</i>

00:01:53.010 --> 00:01:57.810
<i>my emotions pile up like fallen debris</i>

00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:02.090
<i>Kono Kanshou wa Doko e Yuku</i>

00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:02.090
<i>Where do they think they're going?</i>

00:02:02.190 --> 00:02:04.360
<i>Tsuieta Kibou Kakae</i>

00:02:02.190 --> 00:02:04.360
<i>With my crushed hope in tow,</i>

00:02:04.660 --> 00:02:12.320
<i>Akai Ame o Harai Hashitta Muchuu ni</i>

00:02:04.660 --> 00:02:12.320
<i>I ran straight through the bloody rain</i>

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:18.980
<i>Kuzureta Kanjou no Hate ni</i>

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:18.980
<i>After my emotions come spilling out,</i>

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:20.280
<i>Nani o Miru</i>

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:20.280
<i>what will I see?</i>

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:21.550
<i>Nani ga Aru</i>

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:21.550
<i>What will I have?</i>

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:23.230
<i>Mada Shiranai</i>

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:23.230
<i>I still don't know</i>

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:29.110
<i>Hakanai Subete no Minori wa</i>

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:29.110
<i>But in this silence,</i>

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:31.680
<i>Tada Muon ni Me no Mae ni</i>

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:31.680
<i>all of the shallow things I could gain</i>

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:38.690
<i>Hirogari Tsudzuketa</i>

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:38.690
<i>lie endlessly before me</i>

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:09.520
Come on...

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:10.840
Takashi, I'm begging you...

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:15.600
I want to die as myself.

00:03:16.010 --> 00:03:17.390
He isn't going to...

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:19.610
He isn't going to turn into one of them!

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:21.110
Stop!

00:03:31.090 --> 00:03:32.230
What is it?

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:36.280
Well, I want to know what's really going on.

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:37.790
That was blunt.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:39.530
Why would I lie?

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:54.480
Can I see your phone? I wanna try calling my dad.

00:03:54.930 --> 00:03:59.600
I know he's a cop, but how are you gonna contact him when even the police emergency line is busy?

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:04.410
He gave me a private number that I'm not supposed normally to use.

00:04:07.770 --> 00:04:08.950
I got through!

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:09.600
Dad?

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:10.680
Hello?

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:13.190
This phone number... Takashi's?

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:14.200
Dad?

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:15.680
Listen Dad, we're at school right now...

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:16.530
Hello? Is this Takashi?

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:21.050
Call Duration

00:04:16.530 --> 00:04:18.220
Rei must've given you this number.

00:04:18.220 --> 00:04:19.710
Is she okay?

00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:21.050
My connection...

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:23.800
Dad?! You can't hear my voice?!

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:26.930
Listen, this whole city is in a state of panic.

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:27.510
Dad? Dad!

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:27.510
You need to--

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:30.690
Okay?

00:04:30.690 --> 00:04:32.620
This whole city is in a state of panic!

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:34.130
You need to get out ASAP--

00:04:37.650 --> 00:04:39.420
Out of Range

00:04:37.650 --> 00:04:39.420
End of Call

00:04:37.810 --> 00:04:39.100
Out of range?

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:41.740
But I just got through!

00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:43.600
Why?!

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:44.770
Rei!

00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:49.390
Takashi...

00:04:50.050 --> 00:04:51.410
Dad...

00:04:52.110 --> 00:04:57.790
Didn't even know it was me...

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:05.090
T-Takagi, do you happen to have your cell phone on you? It's against the rules, but--

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:07.390
I'm an honors student!

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:10.740
Who would I even call if I had mine?

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:12.640
Uh, well, there's always the police...

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:15.320
You really are stupid.

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:16.860
Just look at how bad this uproar has gotten.

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:19.150
Don't you think someone's tried to call the cops already?

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:21.960
We haven't heard a siren yet, have we?

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:24.780
Do you get it now?

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:27.870
Is the whole city in an uproar?

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:28.880
Probably.

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:31.170
The police have probably been dispatched already.

00:05:31.170 --> 00:05:32.830
But just look at this place...

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:35.540
Should we call like... the SDF?

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:37.150
I wouldn't count on them either.

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:39.580
I know that without orders from the government,

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:42.430
they can't be dispatched for
defense or public security, but--

00:05:42.430 --> 00:05:43.880
I'm not talking about that!

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:46.560
Then what're you--

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:48.320
They're in the same situation as the police.

00:05:48.730 --> 00:05:53.390
Let's say that people all over Japan are eating each other. What do you think is going on?

00:05:53.590 --> 00:05:57.240
Listen, there's 130 million people in Japan.

00:05:57.240 --> 00:06:00.230
Of that 130 million, how many do you think are with the SDF?

00:06:00.230 --> 00:06:04.610
Furthermore, who's to say that this hasn't affected the SDF?

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:09.360
Let's get out of here.

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:11.610
O-Okay!

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:15.580
Sigh, I'm stuck with fatass here since Komuro ran off.

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:18.200
What a drag.

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:20.380
Nurse's Office

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:20.420
O-Okada...

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:25.240
Okada?

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:30.860
Crap!

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:32.410
Sorry!

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:33.300
Sorry!

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:37.350
Sorry! Sorry!

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:39.100
Whatever shall I do?

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:38.920
Sorry! Sorry!

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:40.770
Sorry! Sorry!

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:42.260
I'M SORRY!

00:06:42.260 --> 00:06:45.280
I can't get a hold of the police or the fire department.

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:49.680
I could treat people, but they're screwed once they get bitten,

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:51.820
and they come back to life after they die.

00:06:51.820 --> 00:06:55.370
I feel like I'm in one of those movies that weirdos like.

00:06:55.630 --> 00:06:58.020
Is it really that amazing?

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:00.030
Let's go, Ms. Shizuka!

00:07:00.030 --> 00:07:01.440
Hold on a sec.

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:03.680
I should take whatever I can carry.

00:07:04.210 --> 00:07:05.010
Please hurry!

00:07:08.730 --> 00:07:09.630
Ms. Shizuka!

00:07:12.020 --> 00:07:13.150
Ms. Shizuka!

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:15.390
Run away! Quickly!

00:07:16.820 --> 00:07:19.900
Uhhhh... What'd you say your name was again?

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:21.470
Huh?

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:27.950
H-Hey now...

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:49.810
I am Saeko Busujima, captain of the Kendo Club.

00:07:50.430 --> 00:07:52.800
Tell me, 2nd year, what is your name?

00:07:54.210 --> 00:07:56.420
Kazu... Ishii...

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:01.820
You fought bravely to protect Dr. Marikawa, Ishii.

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:04.570
Your courage is nothing short of praiseworthy.

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:08.390
Do you know what happens to you once you have been bitten?

00:08:08.850 --> 00:08:11.910
Do you wish for your parents or friends to witness you like that?

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:13.390
If you do not,

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:16.440
then I shall end your life for you here and now.

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:18.370
Though, it would be my first time killing another.

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:22.800
P-Please...

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.580
W-Wait a sec, what--

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:28.000
I recognize that you are the school
nurse, but I request you not interfere.

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:33.780
One of our duties as women is to protect a man's pride.

00:08:57.260 --> 00:09:01.000
What do we do now that we're here, Takagi?

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:02.980
Some of it does look useful, but--

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:04.640
Shut up, you fat nerd.

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:07.270
Lock the door so they don't come in here!

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:10.300
I-It's locked!

00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:13.590
Are we going to use these as weapons?

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:18.100
You're one of those so-called military nerds or gun freaks, aren't you?

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:22.560
Haven't you seen an action movie with one of these?

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:24.660
A nail gun?

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:26.410
It's gas powered?

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:27.930
Well duh!

00:09:27.930 --> 00:09:31.390
You wouldn't be able to carry it if it had a
compressor like in the movies, would you?

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:34.020
Jeez, so stupid.

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:35.710
Do you like movies?

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:37.360
Don't be so stupid!

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:40.010
I'm an all-knowing genius!

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:44.390
We have an extra gas canister and extra nails here.

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:46.910
Nothing to worry about.

00:09:46.910 --> 00:09:49.220
How could you not be worried?

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:49.960
They're coming!

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:52.080
They're coming from the hallway!

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:55.030
I'd say it weighs 9 lbs.{lit: 4 kg}

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:57.380
On par with an older assault rifle.

00:09:57.380 --> 00:10:01.010
But my stance will be messed up. It needs a sight.

00:10:01.010 --> 00:10:03.490
Hey, are you ignoring me?!

00:10:08.530 --> 00:10:10.020
Hirano?

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:18.790
No!

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:24.620
Gotcha!

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:26.350
Hirano?

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:29.710
Ready?

00:10:30.010 --> 00:10:31.000
Ready!

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:32.880
Turn it on!

00:10:38.940 --> 00:10:39.840
Aw crap.

00:10:43.770 --> 00:10:47.980
Could you put the drill and nails over there in a bag?

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:49.430
Excuse me?!

00:10:49.430 --> 00:10:51.730
Who gave you of all people the right to order me around?!

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:56.110
Please~?

00:10:58.600 --> 00:11:00.880
Oookay.

00:11:00.880 --> 00:11:01.970
Takashi!

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:03.620
It's okay.

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:07.310
They sound happy to see us.

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:10.290
You all feel great, don't you?

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:12.130
Take this!

00:11:18.960 --> 00:11:22.170
What do you think you're doing? You should carry something too.

00:11:24.520 --> 00:11:28.530
H-Hey, Takagi... Mind if I ask you something?

00:11:28.530 --> 00:11:29.740
What?

00:11:30.230 --> 00:11:33.010
Erm, why me?

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:36.120
No reason in particular.

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:40.340
Oh, okay...

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:45.410
What's with the sudden mood swing?

00:11:45.740 --> 00:11:47.790
Did you come to a realization?

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:50.460
I don't know yet I do know!

00:11:51.610 --> 00:11:52.500
Hirano!

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:53.530
Yes'm!

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:05.310
Gotta hand it to you. It was a good idea to use the fire hose.

00:12:05.310 --> 00:12:07.990
Well, the water pressure is so strong.

00:12:08.270 --> 00:12:12.630
Don't you remember when we were in middle school and we had that fire drill and you and Hisashi...

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:18.400
I'll be sure to remember it this time.

00:12:21.110 --> 00:12:23.220
I think I'm ready to go now.

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:27.410
It'll be rough in there. You sure?

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:37.480
Let's go.

00:12:55.430 --> 00:12:57.130
Where are we going?

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:00.590
Home.

00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:05.090
We'll head to our houses and help survivors along the way.

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:08.640
This is our hometown. We should be able to feel our way around.

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:11.110
Yeah!

00:13:11.110 --> 00:13:12.840
I know my dad is safe, so...

00:13:12.840 --> 00:13:16.630
Hey, you should call your house soon.

00:13:16.630 --> 00:13:18.540
I will sooner or later.

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:21.060
My dad lives away from home because of his job,

00:13:21.060 --> 00:13:24.210
and my mom is an elementary school
teacher so she wouldn't be at home either.

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:26.780
They probably wouldn't shut up if I got a hold of them anyway.

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:30.630
Jeez, we shouldn't be laughing right now.

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:38.230
I wasn't being serious about that, of course.

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:41.830
When I looked at how things were at my own school,

00:13:41.830 --> 00:13:46.960
it frightened me to think of what it was like at my mom's school.

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:01.860
W-What're you doing?

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:04.010
Shut up and watch.

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:12.210
Do you understand now?

00:14:12.210 --> 00:14:15.040
See how he didn't react when that rag hit him?

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:18.960
They don't feel pain so they only react to sound.

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:23.820
I don't think they can see or he
wouldn't have run into that locker.

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:25.520
What about, say, heat?

00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:27.910
We'll try it if we have to.

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:29.440
Let's move.

00:14:29.440 --> 00:14:31.590
Are we really gonna go outside?

00:14:31.590 --> 00:14:33.220
What's wrong with that?

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:36.470
Uhm, I don't like walking...

00:14:36.470 --> 00:14:38.420
This is why I hate fat nerds!

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:41.590
I don't wanna hear you complain about
walking until you're old enough to drive!

00:14:52.610 --> 00:14:56.470
The staff room? What a difficult request you have made.

00:14:56.470 --> 00:15:00.330
But everyone keeps their car keys in there...

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:08.580
Hey, why don't you just kill them? It should be easy for you...

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:11.190
Stopping to crush the head of everything we come across

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:13.430
would be no different than
restricting ourselves from movement.

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:15.160
We would become surrounded.

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:20.400
It would be hard for us to get away should one of them take hold.

00:15:20.400 --> 00:15:23.130
Wow, you really thought about this.

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:28.970
Oh jeez! What was that?

00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:31.670
Such fashion is unsuitable for running.

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:39.440
This is a brand name skirt!

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:43.730
Tell me, which do you value more? Your clothing or your life?

00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:45.940
...both!

00:15:48.070 --> 00:15:49.310
What's that sound?

00:15:49.310 --> 00:15:50.650
Was that from the staff room?

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:59.040
I won't be able to figure out more of their traits if you keep killing them!

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:01.040
Help me fight them, Takagi!

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:03.680
Why the hell do I have to fight?!

00:16:03.680 --> 00:16:05.300
I'm almost out of ammo!

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:09.950
So?! Just reload it!

00:16:09.950 --> 00:16:13.180
But... behind you...

00:16:23.230 --> 00:16:25.210
H-Hirano!

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:27.570
I'm out!

00:16:31.980 --> 00:16:34.800
Don't you dare come near me!

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:36.010
Takagi!

00:16:36.620 --> 00:16:37.900
Go away...

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:39.810
Go away!

00:16:51.890 --> 00:16:54.930
GO AWAY!

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:11.810
I'm sick of these things! I want my mom!

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:15.770
I will take the right!

00:17:15.770 --> 00:17:16.490
Rei!

00:17:16.490 --> 00:17:17.950
And I got the left!

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:54.060
Takagi...

00:17:55.610 --> 00:17:57.840
Are you okay, Takagi?

00:17:57.840 --> 00:17:59.530
Miyamoto...

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:04.080
We are all acquainted with the
school nurse, Dr. Marikawa, yes?

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:07.260
I am Saeko Busujima of 3-A.

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:09.960
I'm Takashi Komuro from 2-B.

00:18:10.450 --> 00:18:14.770
You're the same Busujima-<i>sempai</i> who won at the national championship last year?

00:18:14.770 --> 00:18:17.400
I'm in the Sojutsu Club. My name is Rei Miyamoto.

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:21.490
I'm, uhm, Kohta Hirano from B.

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:23.220
A pleasure to meet all of you.

00:18:27.170 --> 00:18:29.880
What the... You're all so soft.

00:18:30.780 --> 00:18:32.600
"<i>Sempai</i> "? Seriously?

00:18:32.600 --> 00:18:35.490
You two are the same age! You must not know how to count since you got held back a year!

00:18:35.790 --> 00:18:37.760
Hey now, Takagi...

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:39.390
Don't treat me like I'm stupid!

00:18:39.390 --> 00:18:41.050
I'm a genius!

